"""Same Sky (formerly CUI Devices) SJ-3523-SMT-TR - 3.5 mm stereo (TRS) audio jack, SMT.

Primitive package. Right angle, 3 conductors, no internal switches, 5.0 mm
high, 6.0 x 14.5 mm body plus a 2.5 mm long, 5.0 mm diameter nose. Evidence:
Same Sky SJ-352X-SMT datasheet rev 1.07 (2025-04-15) - part number key and
specifications (p1), mechanical drawing, recommended PCB layout (top view),
and schematic/pin table (p2).

Pins (p2 table, SJ-3523-SMT column): 1 = sleeve, 2 = tip, 3 = ring,
4 = NP (not populated). The tip-switch terminal 4 exists only on SJ-3524, so
this package has no switch IO and the footprint omits the terminal-4 land.

Footprint: three SMT lands from the recommended layout (sleeve and ring
2.8 x 2.2 mm, tip 2.8 x 2.8 mm) plus the two 1.70 mm non-plated holes for the
1.5 +/- 0.05 mm, 0.8 mm long locating bosses. The plug enters from the +Y
board edge side; place the nose (2.5 mm past the body) at or over the board
edge.

Limits: 12 V DC, 1 A, 50 mOhm contact resistance, -25 to +85 C, 5,000 cycles,
reflow peak 260 C.
"""

TIP = io(Net)
RING = io(Net)
SLEEVE = io(Net)

Component(
    name="SJ-3523-SMT",
    symbol=Symbol(library="SJ-3523-SMT.kicad_sym"),
    pins={
        "TIP": TIP,
        "RING": RING,
        "SLEEVE": SLEEVE,
    },
)
